    "en": {
      "title": "Basel Framework: CAP30.30 FAQ2 range",
      "summary": "The same FAQ cites 'CAP30.21 to CAP30.30' under CAP30.21 and CAP30.26 but 'CAP30.20 to CAP30.29' under CAP30.30, so the range omits the paragraph it is attached to.",
      "impact": "Position: Holding 100 of a non-common instrument of a 20%-owned bank. Reading a: range -> threshold regime, deduct excess over 10% Reading b: CAP30.30 -> full deduction 100 Difference: up to 100",
      "correction": "Clarify or correct the cited passage so that the rule and its references give one result for the stated case."
    }
  },
